+| Channel | Parameter bounds in model order |
+|---|---|
+| SHK-1 | `g_max` 1-100 nS; `E_rev` -150 to -1 mV; `V_half` -60 to 40 mV; slope 2-50 mV; `tau_min` 0.05-20 ms; `tau_amp` 0-50 ms; `k_tau` 5-100 mV |
