+All three SHK starts converged to the same objective. Two EGL starts reached the same basin; one reported an abnormal line-search termination and is preserved but excluded from winner selection. Five noisy recovery truths per channel show median errors up to 33.8% of the SHK parameter ranges and 20.8% of the EGL parameter ranges. The protocol therefore supports waveform prediction more strongly than unique parameter interpretation.
+
+Leave-one-voltage-out RMSE spans 93.17-406.89 pA for SHK-1 and 9.84-74.85 pA for EGL-19. These errors, especially at voltage-range edges, reject any strong interpolation or extrapolation claim from the present data alone.
 
 ## Claim-evidence matrix
 
 | Claim | Evidence | Outcome |
